              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kopotu ikejaanakinak luka Abisalom mama ejai aberu togo; kotemasi atiar, “Alu bo Akimaas ka Yonatan?” Kotema aberu kes atiar, “Atuboros kaguurut naka akipi.” Kemoata kes, mam apotu kodumutu, koboŋosi Yerusalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
